Handle: 5304418617221955049
DataTable:
  Version: 1
  Type: DialogueDefinition
  Rows:
    GateOpens:
      Speaker: Orin
      Portrait: 0
      Lines:
        - Speaker: ""
          Text: The ground... Get back from the roots!
        - Speaker: Miko
          Text: The light isn't running on to another tree. It's going down, into the earth.
        - Speaker: ""
          Text: Steps. Someone cut steps down there, a long time ago. That's where the thread is pulled from.
    GateSealed:
      Speaker: Orin
      Portrait: 0
      Lines:
        - Speaker: Miko
          Text: The steps go down into the dark, but the air pushes back. Something holds this way shut.
        - Speaker: ""
          Text: A ward, and an old one. Not something a blade can cut. Not yet.
        - Speaker: Miko
          Text: Then we find out who sealed it, and why. We'll come back.
    OrinJoins:
      Speaker: Orin
      Portrait: 0
      Lines:
        - Speaker: ""
          Text: ...That's the last of them. You strike harder than you look.
        - Speaker: Miko
          Text: And you cut cleaner than any sword I've seen. I'm Miko, from the shrine on the hill.
        - Speaker: ""
          Text: Orin. Orin Kenshi. I've been following this light for three days, up from the coast.
        - Speaker: ""
          Text: It runs from old tree to old tree, like a thread pulled tight. Whatever is pulling it waits at the other end.
        - Speaker: Miko
          Text: My master felt it too. He sent me to follow it, wherever it leads.
        - Speaker: ""
          Text: Then we walk the same road. I'll go with you, guardian, as far as the thread goes.
    OrinMeet:
      Speaker: Orin
      Portrait: 0
      Lines:
        - Speaker: ""
          Text: Stay back! These spirits came up out of the ground with the tremor, and they won't stop coming.
        - Speaker: Miko
          Text: That light in the roots... it's the same light as our sacred tree.
        - Speaker: ""
          Text: A shrine maiden? Then you know what this is better than I do. Can you fight?
        - Speaker: Miko
          Text: I'm the shrine's guardian. Of course I can.
        - Speaker: ""
          Text: Good. Stay close, and keep them off my left.
    OrinRetry:
      Speaker: Orin
      Portrait: 0
      Lines:
        - Speaker: ""
          Text: They're still circling the roots. Catch your breath, then we finish this together.
